    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "This will fail when we release twice non-stable because multiple versions will be named the same.\r\n\r\n- Actual\r\n  - `4.2.0-experimental-typescript`\r\n  - `4.2.0-experimental-typescript`\r\n- Expected\r\n  - `4.2.0-experimental-typescript.0`\r\n  - `4.2.0-experimental-typescript.1`\r\n\r\nWe can ignore this if we only release for stable releases, but then we should suffix the version with `.0`.",
